{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c131387"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"物語冒頭で初めてその存在が明らかになった、夜の闇をまとった少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"他の影の化け物達と異なり、言葉を用いる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"彼女が主人公たちに向けるのは底すら見通せない憎悪。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「世界を光なき闇の世界へ」を掲げ、主人公達に宣戦布告する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"全体的に遊びがない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その正体も目的も、全ては謎に包まれている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24995","sourceWorkId":"35267","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"物語冒頭で初めてその存在が明らかになった、夜の闇をまとった少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"他の影の化け物達と異なり、言葉を用いる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"彼女が主人公たちに向けるのは底すら見通せない憎悪。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「世界を光なき闇の世界へ」を掲げ、主人公達に宣戦布告する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"全体的に遊びがない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その正体も目的も、全ては謎に包まれている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"139948"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"69 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24995","sourceWorkId":"35267","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"a","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24995","sourceWorkId":"35267","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"144 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24995","sourceWorkId":"35267","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"70 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24995","sourceWorkId":"35267","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"51 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24995","sourceWorkId":"35267","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a9/a992a8f313dbcbb38717f795672501ad241329e7fc5d956577e3f27ad239ea99.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/76/76311634552ad297ce25f2bb698b2c67839483cd4e99fb638c30ad6297026e6d.webp","width":160,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"藤田茜","creatorId":"vndb:s8737","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s8737","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s8737","name":"藤田 茜","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:459368:139948:17981:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c131388","characterName":"神ちゃん","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c131388"},"originalCharacterName":"神ちゃん","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The god of this world, and the very one who summoned the protagonist group here."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She prefers to be called \"God-chan\" rather than \"God\" or whatever—somehow acts like you're buddies."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is the type who won't leave you alone, possessing people's bodies (usually Nozomi-sensei's) to meddle in everything, yet never says anything useful."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Tread carefully—she nags endlessly."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c131388"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"actors":[{"creditedName":"くすはら ゆい","creatorId":"vndb:s985","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s985","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s985","name":"石原 舞","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:96225","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c131389","characterName":"小野宮 シン","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c131389"},"originalCharacterName":"小野宮 シン","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The protagonist of this story. A second-year student at Kamui Academy, where the tale unfolds."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Having only recently been summoned to this world, he still struggles to fully accept his new environment and his destined role."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He possesses a strong allergy to lies—a trait directly reflected in his unique ability."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Since his power isn’t combat-oriented, he isn’t particularly useful in world-saving missions."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Though socially withdrawn, he maintains somewhat of a relationship with the other heroes out of duty."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Ability: \"Doubt\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"The power to detect falsehood in others’ words. He can determine when someone is speaking a lie—whether intentionally or unintentionally. However, it merely identifies falsehood without discerning the speaker’s true intent or the actual truth."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c131389"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"actors":[]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"vndb:p273","sourceCompanyId":"egs:brand:1888","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p273","name":"Whirlpool","roleCodes":["brand"],"identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-brand:35267:1888","source":"egs"},{"companyId":"vndb:p273","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p273","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p273","name":"ワールプール","roleCodes":["developer","publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:124478:v47458","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p273","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p273","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p273","name":"ワールプール","roleCodes":["developer","publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:128157:v47458","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p273","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p273","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p273","name":"ワールプール","roleCodes":["developer","publisher"],"identityStatus":"